      "text": "Scheduler Service\n(32 copies, each owns\nsome shards: lease)\n\nIN: job-changes ->\nupdate the timetable\n\nEVERY SECOND:\n1 apply changes\n2 publish due jobs\n3 schedule next run\n4 checkpoint + renew",
