    {
      "id": "Asum",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1220.0,
      "y": 580.0,
      "width": 952.0,
      "height": 140.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1945,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1952,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE: Job API saves the job (Cosmos, pk = shard) -> change feed -> Kafka job-changes\n-> the Scheduler Service copy that OWNS that shard adds it to its in-memory timetable.\nEvery second the owner publishes each job due now to Kafka job-runs, then works out the next run\nIN MEMORY (no DB write per run). Executors: 1 INSERT run, UNIQUE (jobId, scheduledTime)\nstops duplicates -> 2 tenant rate limit -> 3 call the target with Idempotency-Key = runId\n-> 4 save the status; failures -> job-retries with backoff, then 'failed'.\nREAD: job list from a by-tenant view; run history from Runs.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITE: Job API saves the job (Cosmos, pk = shard) -> change feed -> Kafka job-changes\n-> the Scheduler Service copy that OWNS that shard adds it to its in-memory timetable.\nEvery second the owner publishes each job due now to Kafka job-runs, then works out the next run\nIN MEMORY (no DB write per run). Executors: 1 INSERT run, UNIQUE (jobId, scheduledTime)\nstops duplicates -> 2 tenant rate limit -> 3 call the target with Idempotency-Key = runId\n-> 4 save the status; failures -> job-retries with backoff, then 'failed'.\nREAD: job list from a by-tenant view; run history from Runs.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
